  "description": "Welcome To The Guardians!\n\nWe are playing for fun here, that means there are no restrictions.\n\n!!!Except for inactivity!!!\nIf you have been checked as offline for more than 7 days then you will be kicked to make room for new members.\n\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! IMPORTANT !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\nPlayers who dont Help the Guild to grow by not  Donating some wood or bars to the Guild&#039;s Stock will get kicked During the 7 days of inactivity.\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! IMPORTANT !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n\n&quot;Raids&quot;\nWe do Raids for fun,  mostly on the weekends, (Friday to Sunday) you are welcome to join Raids or ignore Raids.\n\nOther than that i hope you have a great time as part of The Guardians.\n\nGuild Founded by Dragonwarrior92\n\nGuild Established 15.11.2025\n\nGuild Leader: Dragonwarrior92\n\nDeputies: Bratinproud67, Zzzzzzzzzzzz and SentinelPrime.\n\nOfficers: Xxxxxxxxxxxxxx, Dodot12373, Mackers345 and Wizzago \n\nThe Guardians Discord Server Link below.\nhttps://discord.gg/wGVzEXSVak",
